DensePack performs all processing locally on the user's machine.

It does not transmit, collect, or store any data. No files, text, or images are sent to any external service.

The only network access is for installing Python and its dependencies (Pillow, freetype-py, NumPy) on first run via the user's package manager. 

The Inter font is bundled with the plugin and requires no download.

Generated image files are written to the user's local filesystem.
